{'symbol': 'ABT', 'date': '2022-12-21 09:00:00', 'title': "ABBOTT'S FREESTYLE LIBRE® 3 INTEGRATED WITH AUTOMATED INSULIN DELIVERY SYSTEM MYLIFE™ LOOP IN GERMANY", 'text': "FIRST AUTOMATED INSULIN DELIVERY (AID) SYSTEM IN THE WORLD TO WORK WITH ABBOTT'S FREESTYLE LIBRE® 3 SENSOR AUTOMATED PROCESS STREAMLINES AND IMPROVES DAILY DIABETES MANAGEMENT FOR PEOPLE WHO ARE ON INSULIN THERAPY1 HYBRID CLOSED-LOOP SYSTEM MYLIFE™ LOOP INCORPORATES TECHNOLOGY FROM TWO PARTNERS: CAMDIAB'S ALGORITHM AUTOMATICALLY ADJUSTS INSULIN DOSAGE ON YPSOMED'S INSULIN PUMP, MYLIFE™ YPSOPUMP®, BASED ON ACCURATE2, REAL-TIME GLUCOSE INFORMATION FROM FREESTYLE LIBRE\xa03 SENSOR ABBOTT PARK, ILL., DEC. 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ABBOTT (NYSE: ABT) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS FREESTYLE LIBRE® 3 SENSOR IS NOW COMPATIBLE WITH THE MYLIFE™ LOOP SOLUTION FROM PARTNERS, YPSOMED AND CAMDIAB, CREATING A SMART, AUTOMATED PROCESS TO DELIVER INSULIN BASED ON REAL-TIME GLUCOSE DATA."}{'symbol': 'AFL', 'date': '2022-12-21 08:00:00', 'title': "AFLAC RECOGNIZED FOR 22ND TIME AS A BEST PLACE TO WORK IN IT BY FOUNDRY'S COMPUTERWORLD", 'text': 'INSURER RANKS NO. 31 AMONG LARGE ORGANIZATIONS FOR EXCELLENCE IN IT EMPLOYEE COMPENSATION, BENEFITS, GROWTH OPPORTUNITY COLUMBUS, GA.'}{'symbol': 'AMZN', 'date': '2022-12-21 08:30:00', 'title': 'LONG-TERM AMAZON INVESTOR ALERT: KASKELA LAW LLC ANNOUNCES STOCKHOLDER INVESTIGATION OF AMAZON.COM, INC. (AMZN) AND ENCOURAGES LONG-TERM INVESTORS TO CONTACT THE FIRM', 'text': 'PHILADELPHIA , DEC. 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- KASKELA LAW LLC ANNOUNCES THAT IT IS INVESTIGATING AMAZON.COM, INC. ("AMAZON") (NASDAQ: AMZN) ON BEHALF OF THE COMPANY\'S LONG-TERM INVESTORS. ACCORDING TO A RECENTLY FILED COMPLAINT, CERTAIN OF AMAZON\'S CURRENT AND FORMER SENIOR EXECUTIVE OFFICERS ARE ALLEGED TO HAVE BREACHED THEIR FIDUCIARY DUTIES BY "KNOWINGLY AND/OR RECKLESSLY CAUSING THE COMPANY TO STORE THE BIOMETRIC INFORMATION OF ITS EMPLOYEES, USERS, AND ITS CLOUD-BASED CLIENTS\' USERS, INCLUDING MINORS, WITHOUT INFORMING THEM OF THESE PRACTICES AND WITHOUT SECURING USERS\' WRITTEN CONSENT, AND TO FAIL TO DEVELOP A WRITTEN POLICY AVAILABLE TO THE PUBLIC THAT SET A RETENTION SCHEDULE AND GUIDELINES FOR USERS TO PERMANENTLY DESTROY BIOMETRIC IDENTIFIERS WHEN THE INITIAL PURPOSE FOR COLLECTION WAS SATISFIED" IN DIRECT VIOLATION OF STATE PRIVACY LAWS.'}{'symbol': 'AMCR', 'date': '2022-12-21 15:00:00', 'title': "AMCOR PARTNERS WITH LICELLA TO DELIVER RECYCLED CONTENT FROM ONE OF AUSTRALIA'S FIRST PLASTIC ADVANCED RECYCLING FACILITIES", 'text': "MELBOURNE, AUSTRALIA , DEC. 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AMCOR (NYSE: AMCR) (ASX:AMC), A GLOBAL LEADER IN RESPONSIBLE PACKAGING SOLUTIONS, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS AMCOR AUSTRALIA & NEW ZEALAND (ANZ) BUSINESS HAS SIGNED A MEMORANDUM OF UNDERSTANDING (MOU) WITH AUSTRALIAN-BASED TECHNOLOGY PIONEERS, LICELLA HOLDINGS,\xa0TO INVEST IN ONE OF AUSTRALIA'S FIRST PLASTIC ADVANCED RECYCLING FACILITIES. AS ONE OF THE FIRST ADVANCED RECYCLING FACILITIES TO BE BUILT IN AUSTRALIA, THE AGREEMENT SUPPORTS AMCOR AND LICELLA'S COMMITMENT TO CREATING A LOCAL CIRCULAR ECONOMY FOR SOFT PLASTICS IN AUSTRALIA AND HELPS ADVANCE AMCOR'S TARGET TO ACHIEVE 30% RECYCLED CONTENT ACROSS ITS PORTFOLIO BY 2030."}{'symbol': 'AWK', 'date': '2022-12-21 15:34:00', 'title': 'AMERICAN WATER CHARITABLE FOUNDATION PROVIDES $40,000 DONATION TO CENTER FOR AQUATIC SCIENCES', 'text': 'CAMDEN, N.J.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--THE AMERICAN WATER CHARITABLE FOUNDATION, A 501(C)(3) ORGANIZATION ESTABLISHED BY AMERICAN WATER, THE LARGEST PUBLICLY TRADED U.S. WATER AND WASTEWATER UTILITY COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED A $40,000 DONATION TO THE CENTER FOR AQUATIC SCIENCES IN SUPPORT OF THEIR 2023 COMMUNITY AND URBAN SCIENCE ENRICHMENT (“CAUSE”) PROGRAM.'}{'symbol': 'AWK', 'date': '2022-12-21 10:00:00', 'title': 'ILLINOIS AMERICAN WATER SHARES VIDEO REMINDING CUSTOMERS TO KEEP FATS, OILS AND GREASE FROM CRASHING HOLIDAY PARTIES', 'text': 'BELLEVILLE, ILL.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--ILLINOIS AMERICAN WATER IS SHARING AN ANIMATED PUBLIC SERVICE VIDEO REMINDING CUSTOMERS TO PROPERLY DISPOSE OF FATS, OILS AND GREASE (FOG) THIS HOLIDAY SEASON. PROPERLY DISPOSING OF FOG CAN HELP PREVENT CLOGS IN HOUSEHOLD PLUMBING AND SEWER LINES. THE VIDEO FEATURES UGLY SWEATER-WEARING CHARACTERS FATS, OIL, AND GREASE AS UNINVITED HOLIDAY PARTY GUESTS WHO THREATEN TO WREAK HAVOC ON PIPES.'}{'symbol': 'AJG', 'date': '2022-12-21 08:00:00', 'title': 'ARTHUR J. GALLAGHER & CO. ACQUIRES INTERBROK GROUP', 'text': 'ROLLING MEADOWS, ILL. , DEC. 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ARTHUR J.'}{'symbol': 'BLK', 'date': '2022-12-21 07:50:00', 'title': 'BLACKROCK® CANADA ANNOUNCES ESTIMATED DECEMBER CASH DISTRIBUTIONS FOR THE ISHARES® ETFS', 'text': 'TORONTO, DEC. 21, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BLACKROCK ASSET MANAGEMENT CANADA LIMITED (“BLACKROCK CANADA”), AN INDIRECT, WHOLLY-OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF BLACKROCK, INC. (NYSE: BLK), TODAY ANNOUNCED THE ESTIMATED DECEMBER CASH DISTRIBUTIONS FOR THE ISHARES ETFS LISTED ON THE TSX OR NEO. UNITHOLDERS OF RECORD OF A FUND ON DECEMBER 30, 2022 WILL RECEIVE CASH DISTRIBUTIONS PAYABLE IN RESPECT OF THAT FUND ON JANUARY 5, 2023.'}{'symbol': 'BKNG', 'date': '2022-12-21 20:11:00', 'title': 'FAMILY AND FRIEND GROUP TRAVEL BACK ON THE CARDS AGODA SURVEY SHOWS', 'text': "FOUR OUT OF FIVE WILL TAKE A FAMILY HOLIDAY IN THE NEXT 12 MONTHS TRAVELLING WITH A GROUP OF FRIENDS IS MORE LIKELY THAN TRAVELLING WITH EXTENDED FAMILY\xa0 FAMILIES GRAVITATE TOWARDS BUDGET ACCOMMODATION, AGODA HOMES STYLE VACATION RENTALS AND ALL INCLUSIVE RESORTS SINGAPORE , DEC. 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WITH YEAR-END SCHOOL HOLIDAYS IN FULL SWING, DIGITAL TRAVEL PLATFORM AGODA'S FAMILY TRAVEL TREND SURVEY 2022 REVEALS THAT FOUR OUT OF FIVE TRAVELERS WILL TAKE A VACATION WITH IMMEDIATE FAMILY IN THE NEXT 12 MONTHS AND, WHILE TRAVELLING WITH FRIENDS PROVES MORE POPULAR THAN TRAVELLING WITH EXTENDED FAMILY, STILL MORE THAN HALF (52%) ARE KEEN TO CATCH UP WITH RELATIVES FOR THEIR VACATION. TRAVELERS FROM SINGAPORE (61%), TAIWAN (61%) AND VIETNAM (59%) ARE MOST LIKELY TO TAKE AT LEAST ONE TRIP WITH IMMEDIATE FAMILY."}{'symbol': 'CZR', 'date': '2022-12-21 11:20:00', 'title': "CASINO METRO AND CAESARS SPORTSBOOK LAUNCH SPORTS BETTING AT PUERTO RICO'S LARGEST CASINO", 'text': 'SAN JUAN, PUERTO RICO , DEC. 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CASINO METRO, PUERTO RICO\'S LARGEST CASINO,\xa0TODAY\xa0ANNOUNCED\xa0THE OPENING OF ITS SPORTSBOOK\xa0WITH CAESARS SPORTSBOOK,\xa0A DIVISION OF CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT, INC. (NASDAQ: CZR) ("CAESARS"). THE\xa0PARTNERSHIP\xa0BRINGS\xa0CAESARS SPORTSBOOK\'S\xa0ELEVATED RETAIL SPORTS BETTING PRODUCT TO CASINO METRO\'S GUESTS\xa0WITH PLANS TO LAUNCH THE CAESARS SPORTSBOOK MOBILE APP IN PUERTO RICO IN 2023, SUBJECT TO REGULATORY APPROVALS.'}{'symbol': 'CCL', 'date': '2022-12-21 09:15:00', 'title': 'CARNIVAL CORPORATION & PLC PROVIDES FOURTH QUARTER 2022 BUSINESS UPDATE', 'text': 'MIAMI , DEC. 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CARNIVAL CORPORATION & PLC (NYSE/LSE: CCL; NYSE: CUK) PROVIDES FOURTH QUARTER 2022 BUSINESS UPDATE. U.S. GAAP NET LOSS OF $1.6 BILLION, OR $(1.27) DILUTED EPS AND ADJUSTED NET LOSS OF $1.1 BILLION, OR $(0.85) ADJUSTED EPS, FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2022 (SEE "NON-GAAP FINANCIAL MEASURES" BELOW).'}{'symbol': 'CBOE', 'date': '2022-12-21 09:36:00', 'title': 'CBOE APPOINTS VIKESH PATEL AS PRESIDENT OF CBOE CLEAR EUROPE', 'text': 'AMSTERDAM AND LONDON , DEC. 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CBOE GLOBAL MARKETS INC. (CBOE: CBOE), A LEADING PROVIDER OF GLOBAL MARKET INFRASTRUCTURE AND TRADABLE PRODUCTS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF VIKESH PATEL AS PRESIDENT OF CBOE CLEAR EUROPE, ITS LEADING PAN-EUROPEAN CLEARING HOUSE. MR. PATEL WILL JOIN THE COMPANY IN EARLY 2023, SUBJECT TO REGULATORY APPROVAL.'}{'symbol': 'CNC', 'date': '2022-12-21 14:25:00', 'title': 'HEALTH NET PROVIDING SPECIAL ASSISTANCE TO MEMBERS AFFECTED BY EARTHQUAKE', 'text': 'HEALTH NET ASSISTING MEMBERS IN HUMBOLDT COUNTY DURING STATE OF EMERGENCY SACRAMENTO, CALIF. , DEC. 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- IN RESPONSE TO GOV.'}{'symbol': 'CB', 'date': '2022-12-21 12:15:00', 'title': 'CHUBB NAMES TERESA BLACK EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER, NORTH AMERICA SURETY', 'text': 'WHITEHOUSE STATION, N.J. , DEC.\xa021, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CHUBB HAS APPOINTED TERESA BLACK EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER OF NORTH AMERICA SURETY.'}{'symbol': 'CTAS', 'date': '2022-12-21 08:30:00', 'title': 'CINTAS CORPORATION ANNOUNCES FISCAL 2023 SECOND QUARTER RESULTS', 'text': "CINCINNATI--( BUSINESS WIRE )--CINTAS CORPORATION (NASDAQ: CTAS) TODAY REPORTED RESULTS FOR ITS FISCAL 2023 SECOND QUARTER ENDED NOVEMBER 30, 2022. REVENUE FOR THE SECOND QUARTER OF FISCAL 2023 WAS $2.17 BILLION COMPARED TO $1.92 BILLION IN LAST YEAR'S SECOND QUARTER, AN INCREASE OF 13.1%. THE ORGANIC REVENUE GROWTH RATE FOR THE SECOND QUARTER OF FISCAL 2023, WHICH ADJUSTS FOR THE IMPACTS OF ACQUISITIONS, DIVESTITURES AND FOREIGN CURRENCY EXCHANGE RATE FLUCTUATIONS, WAS 12.8%."}{'symbol': 'CMCSA', 'date': '2022-12-21 07:00:00', 'title': "PEPPER CONSUMER IOT PLATFORM AND NOTION, COMCAST'S INSURTECH BUSINESS UNIT, COMBINE TO CREATE A LEADING IOT PLATFORM COMPANY", 'text': 'KANSAS CITY, MO. & DENVER--( BUSINESS WIRE )--PEPPER AND NOTION ANNOUNCED TODAY THEY HAVE COMBINED, CREATING A LEADING IOT AND SMART HOME PLATFORM BUSINESS THAT WILL OFFER INSURANCE CARRIERS CUSTOMIZED, SEAMLESS AND CONNECTED SOLUTIONS IN THE FAST GROWING INSURTECH AND IOT INDUSTRIES. PEPPER ENABLES BUSINESSES WORLDWIDE TO BUILD, DELIVER AND MONETIZE SECURE CONNECTED DEVICES AND SERVICES TO CONSUMERS THROUGH A SUSTAINABLE REVENUE MODEL. NOTION IS AN EASY-TO-USE DIY SMART PROPERTY MONITORING SENSOR SYSTEM AND APP TO ENABLE HOME AND SMALL BUSINESS OWNERS TO PROACTIVELY MONITOR AND REDUCE LOSS FROM COSTLY PROPERTY DAMAGES. COMCAST, THE PREVIOUS OWNER OF NOTION, HAS MADE AN INVESTMENT IN THE PEPPER/NOTION COMBINATION.'}{'symbol': 'CAG', 'date': '2022-12-21 07:30:00', 'title': 'CONAGRA BRANDS ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND PAYMENT'